 "headline": "Wembanyama And Herro Combine For 100",
 "notes": [
  "Victor Wembanyama dropped 50 points, 18 rebounds and 4 steals for Nova Knicks, and Zero Fox Given still needs a miracle to avoid the wrong side of this.",
